{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816260-line","text":"你坐在时间代理银行的人工服务台前，透过水缸，娇小的柜员在处理器前变换表皮的色彩，向你简述大致的开户流程。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816261-line","text":"「再确认一次，您将存入100个标准时的定期存款，按照2％的利率，时间代理银行将在五个公转周期后向您支付报酬。如确认无误，请遵照开户流程进行验证。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816262-line","text":"你点点头，伸出双手，手指与柜员的触手在屏幕上相接，完成一对一的身份校验。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816263-line","text":"「为确保您的账户安全，请您在开户前设置二级密保问题，请在屏幕上完成后续操作。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-18016369363893169877-choice","text":"西红柿的末端。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-1475814299079052968-effect","text":"我的出生地是：西红柿的末端。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-17356878228807786695-choice","text":"第Ⅸ机关单位大院。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-2774113032651042041-effect","text":"我的出生地是：第Ⅸ机关单位大院。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-12575564917278009569-choice","text":"黑塔空间站。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-7245982328111581423-effect","text":"我的出生地是：黑塔空间站。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-16490267249470269080-choice","text":"超合金混凝土。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-14239440115676918388-effect","text":"我的种族为：超合金混凝土","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-4202703463018206676-choice","text":"智人。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-13176803004641920961-effect","text":"我的种族为：智人。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-18433729470781195014-choice","text":"食虫菌毯。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-72894499265368797-effect","text":"我的种族为：食虫菌毯。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816268-line","text":"「设置已完成。本行为首次开通服务的客户准备了礼品，请到前台窗口处凭储蓄卡领取。」触手将一张防水套里的银行卡递给你。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-18211762930924668826-choice","text":"取走银行卡。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816270-line","text":"「感谢您对时间代理银行的支持——请时刻牢记，时间就是金钱。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
